<title>USA: N.Y. Dorm $20 mln NYU deal not repriced -- Morgan.</title>
<headline>N.Y. Dorm $20 mln NYU deal not repriced -- Morgan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co. said Tuesday it received the verbal award on Dormitory Authority of the State of New York's $20 million New York University bond deal without a repricing.</p>
<p>The pricing follows:  </p>
<p>Dormitory Authority of the State of New York</p>
<p>RE: $20,000,000*</p>
<p>New York University</p>
<p>Insured Revenue Bonds, Series 1997A</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>THERE WILL BE NO CHANGE IN PRICE.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 04/15/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 07/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>07/01/1998		1,880M    4.50  %	  4.00</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 100.543)</p>
<p>07/01/1999		1,950M    5.50  %	  4.50</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 102.004)</p>
<p>07/01/2000		2,025M    5.50  %	  4.70</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 102.297)</p>
<p>07/01/2001		2,110M    5.50  %	  4.80</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 102.588)</p>
<p>07/01/2002		2,200M    5.50  %	  4.90</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 102.686)</p>
<p>07/01/2003		2,295M    5.50  %	  5.00</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 102.605)</p>
<p>07/01/2004		2,400M    5.50  %	  5.05</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 102.66 )</p>
<p>07/01/2005		2,510M    6.00  %	  5.10</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 105.921)</p>
<p>07/01/2006		2,630M    6.00  %	  5.15</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 106.122)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected April 29, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on May 14, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co. Incorporated</p>
<p>George K. Baum &amp; Company</p>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
